  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Governance, Protection and Economic Resilience of Communities Located at the Border between Haiti and the Dominican Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at improving governance, protection and economic resilience of communities located at the border between Haiti and the Dominican Republic. IOM proposes to develop a threefold approach to tackle those issues in the framework of this project by reinforcing government capacities to deliver documentation in border areas; supporting migrant assistance in border areas in collaboration with local authorities; and increasing technical capacities for border community members and migrants to reinforce their reintegration in the local economy.</narrative>
  </description>
